  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>漿果與櫻桃</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QIIeplP.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1102\" height=\"220\"><br></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🍇&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">這是什麼？</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>漿果與櫻桃</strong>是<strong>農夫樂事</strong>的擴充模組，新增多種漿果、櫻桃及其他水果。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">主世界會自然生成野生漿果叢與櫻桃樹。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">漿果、櫻桃與特定水果可製作成果汁與果醬。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模組內還包含派類及其他美味點心！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🔍&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">特色內容</span></strong></span></span></h2><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">櫻桃樹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">漿果叢與兩格高的漿果叢</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">派類點心</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">果醬</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">果汁</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿著盔甲可避免接觸漿果叢時受傷</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用剪刀採集漿果可避免被荊棘刺傷</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🔮 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">規劃中的功能</span></strong></span></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多食物種類</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多水果、果樹、漿果與漿果叢變種</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎提出建議！</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🍓 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">方塊/物品</span></span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">果醬罐 - 可填充果醬的容器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">漿果搗碎器 - 用於取得製作果醬所需的漿果汁</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可放置的果醬罐 - 右鍵點擊將果醬罐放置在世界中，每種果醬最多放置3罐！按住Shift右鍵或直接破壞即可收回</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>📋 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">常見問題</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：<strong>會有Fabric版本嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：目前沒有計畫，但未來有可能開發。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：<strong>會回溯支援舊版本嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：目前僅規劃支援1.18.2與1.19.2版本。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：<strong>模組相容性？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：有空時樂意為需求模組添加相容性支援。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：<strong>可以新增X語言的翻譯嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：當然可以。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🔧 <strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">合成配方</span></span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eGmmRyp.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G1dSoEz.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">📷 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">遊戲截圖</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KWWjJ8N.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"712\" height=\"477\"></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v0Q6JSK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"711\" height=\"383\"></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fTothvq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"711\" height=\"499\"></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mCZM6dn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"710\" height=\"382\"></strong></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
